# WHAT: what the shared service Dockerfile (./Dockerfile) leaves out of its build.
# WHY:  the services never need the website's sources. Without this, editing a
#       page would rebuild every service image and restart the whole back end.
#       web-ui/pom.xml stays in, so the Maven reactor still sees the module (it
#       packages an empty WAR here, which no service image uses).
**/target/
.git/
.idea/
*.iml
docs/
web-ui/src/
web-ui/Dockerfile*
